    "Hand-maintained facts for the GAM adapter's geo targeting; no GAM id is written here.",
    "geo_targets.csv holds rows copied unchanged from Google's published geo target file, geotargets-2026-08-12.csv (https://developers.google.com/static/google-ads/api/data/geo/geotargets-2026-08-12.csv.zip, linked from https://developers.google.com/ad-manager/api/geotargets): every Country row, and the row of each region below.",
    "regions: each ISO 3166-2 code this seller accepts, with the Name and Target Type of its row in that file. The loader books the one row under the code's country with that name and type. To add a region, add its entry here and copy its row into geo_targets.csv.",
    "nielsen_dma: the Nielsen DMA codes this seller accepts. Google's published file has no DMA rows; GAM's DMA region id is 200000 plus the Nielsen code, as SELECT Id, Name FROM Geo_Target WHERE Type = 'DMA_REGION' shows on any network."
